{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Asher's line in [C]Gos[Dm]hen stands
[Bb]Im[F]nah and Ish[C]vah [Dm]in the land
[Bb]Is[F]hvi walks [C]with [Dm]sister Ser[Bb]ah
[C]Beriah [Am]holds the father's [Dm]care
[Bb]Heber and Malchiel are [Dm]born
